4:["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Exams"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"GRE AND GMAT"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"HOW TO CRACK GRE AND GMAT? WHAT IS GRE? The full form of (GRE) is Graduate record examinations. It is a standard test that is taken for admissions requirement for many graduate schools in the United States and Canada and other few countries. GRE measures the overall academic readiness of a candidate who wants to attend the graduate school."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","The guide",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The guide"}],[["$","p","GRE exam is scheduled multiple times in a year. GRE Subject Tests are only extended to physics , chemistry, Psychology and mathematics.",{"children":"GRE exam is scheduled multiple times in a year. GRE Subject Tests are only extended to physics , chemistry, Psychology and mathematics."}],["$","p","The exam pattern for GRE :- verbal reasoning, quantitative reasoning and analytical writing skills.",{"children":"The exam pattern for GRE :- verbal reasoning, quantitative reasoning and analytical writing skills."}],["$","p","This test is about 3 hours and 45 minutes.",{"children":"This test is about 3 hours and 45 minutes."}],["$","p","Types of GRE exam ?",{"children":"Types of GRE exam ?"}],["$","p","There are 2 types of GRE tests :-",{"children":"There are 2 types of GRE tests :-"}],["$","p","1.",{"children":"1."}],["$","p","General test(GRE)",{"children":"General test(GRE)"}],["$","p","2.",{"children":"2."}],["$","p","Subject test (GRE)",{"children":"Subject test (GRE)"}],["$","p","GRE exam fees :-",{"children":"GRE exam fees :-"}],["$","p","US $213 = 17,394.11 Indian Rupee.",{"children":"US $213 = 17,394.11 Indian Rupee."}],["$","p","GRE slot booking:-",{"children":"GRE slot booking:-"}],["$","p","GRE Exam Slot Booking: The GRE slot booking is the process of GRE exam registration. The GRE slot booking consists of three fine steps:",{"children":"GRE Exam Slot Booking: The GRE slot booking is the process of GRE exam registration. The GRE slot booking consists of three fine steps:"}],["$","p","1.GRE Registration",{"children":"1.GRE Registration"}],["$","p","2.GRE Exam Dates",{"children":"2.GRE Exam Dates"}],["$","p","3.GRE Test Centres",{"children":"3.GRE Test Centres"}],["$","p","Sections of GRE exam :-",{"children":"Sections of GRE exam :-"}],["$","p","i) It asses Reading Comprehension, Text Completion and Sentence Equivalence.",{"children":"i) It asses Reading Comprehension, Text Completion and Sentence Equivalence."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Verbal Reasoning:-",{"children":"Verbal Reasoning:-"}]]}]]}],["$","section","ii) Each section consists of 20 questions",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"ii) Each section consists of 20 questions"}],[["$","p","iii) 20 questions – 6 text completion, 4 sentence equivalence, and 10 critical reading questions.",{"children":"iii) 20 questions – 6 text completion, 4 sentence equivalence, and 10 critical reading questions."}],["$","p","i) It asses basic high-school level mathematical knowledge and reasoning skills.",{"children":"i) It asses basic high-school level mathematical knowledge and reasoning skills."}],["$","p","ii) Consists of 20 questions :- 8 quantitative comparisons, 9 problem solving items, and 3 data interpretation questions.",{"children":"ii) Consists of 20 questions :- 8 quantitative comparisons, 9 problem solving items, and 3 data interpretation questions."}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14"],"$L15"]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f"]}]}],"$L20"]}]
